; Racingroovy VS (Japan) [SLPS-00417]

[Fix Memory Card Boot Delay]
Description = Removes the long boot delay when a memory card is present without Racingroovy save data.
Type = Gameshark
Activation = EndFrame
; The boot loader reloads the directory up to 30 times when its save is absent.
; Return after the first successful card check and missing-save result.
; Keep the delay-slot assignment of status 3 and the epilogue's return-value
; conversion at 80062A20. Read errors and checksum failures still retry.
AA0629D0 00000001
08018A85 08018A88  ; j 80062A14 -> j 80062A20
